Upstream bug: OpenAI-compatible retrieve, list and delete adapters discard
extra_headers before calling the OpenAI SDK. Upload/content already forward it.

No upstream report yet.

Carry per-request extra_headers through the sync/async adapters. This patch has
no ownership policy; custom identity injection lives in files-identity.patch.

Removal check: tests/verify_files_ownership.py must pass without this patch once
upstream forwards the headers (with the permanent ownership integration enabled).

